msgstr "同步人体表现试验 · 20 秒"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s made %(score)s 6️⃣7️⃣ moves in 20 seconds. Their video will play beside "
"yours."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s 在 20 秒内完成了 %(score)s 次 6️⃣7️⃣ 动作。他们的视频会与你同步播放。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:30
msgid "POSE KINETICS LAB · 20 SECOND PROTOCOL"
msgstr "姿态动力学实验室 · 20 秒协议"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:32
msgid ""
"Move your arms up and down in the 6–7 pattern. Make as many counted moves as "
"you can in 20 seconds."
msgstr "按 6–7 模式上下摆动双臂，在 20 秒内完成尽可能多的有效动作。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:37
msgid "PUBLIC VIDEO LEADERBOARD"
msgstr "公开视频排行榜"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:39
msgid "HALL OF FAME"
msgstr "名人堂"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:40
msgid "Watch runs · preview videos · challenge scores"
msgstr "观看记录 · 预览视频 · 挑战分数"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:43
msgid "Manage all submitted runs"
msgstr "管理全部投稿"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:43
msgid "Manage my submitted runs"
msgstr "管理我的投稿"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:49
msgid "Camera privacy:"
msgstr "摄像头隐私："

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:49
msgid ""
"Pose detection and recording run in this browser. Every run is recorded "
"locally from the countdown, but nothing uploads unless you choose to submit "
"it. Submitting publishes the video for everyone to watch; resetting or "
"closing discards it."
msgstr ""
"姿态检测和录像都在本浏览器内运行。每局会从倒计时开始在本地录制，但只有你主动"
"提交才会上传。提交后视频会公开供所有人观看；重置或关闭页面会丢弃录像。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:66
msgid "Recorded event timeline ready"
msgstr "原始计数时间线已就绪"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:66
msgid "Legacy run · estimated count pace"
msgstr "旧记录 · 使用估算计数节奏"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:76
msgid "Camera is currently doing nothing."
msgstr "摄像头目前什么也没干。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:79
msgid "RECORDING LOCALLY"
msgstr "正在本地录像"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:83
msgid "Preloading pose model — camera remains off"
msgstr "正在预加载姿态模型——摄像头仍关闭"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:90
msgid "6️⃣7️⃣ moves counted"
msgstr "已计 6️⃣7️⃣ 动作"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:93
msgid "time remaining"
msgstr "剩余时间"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:96
msgid "score to beat"
msgstr "目标分数"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:98
msgid "View HOF entry"
msgstr "查看名人堂记录"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:102
msgid "Enable camera"
msgstr "启用摄像头"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:103
msgid "Detector is still loading…"
msgstr "检测器仍在加载……"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:104
msgid ""
"I'm ready starts a local recording with the live count burned into the "
"video. Submitting remains your decision."
msgstr ""
"点击“我准备好了”会开始本地录像，并把实时计数写入视频。是否提交仍由你决定。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:105
msgid "Run this foolish experiment again"
msgstr "再做一次这项愚蠢实验"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:112
msgid "PEER-REVIEWED BY YOURSELF"
msgstr "由你本人完成同行评审"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:113
msgid "6️⃣7️⃣ moves in 20 seconds"
msgstr "次 6️⃣7️⃣ 动作 / 20 秒"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:114
msgid "A result has occurred."
msgstr "一个结果发生了。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:118
msgid ""
"The recording remains local unless you submit it below. The downloaded and "
"uploaded video includes the live 67 count. Closing or resetting discards it."
msgstr ""
"除非你在下方提交，否则录像只保留在本地。下载和上传的视频都会包含实时 67 计"
"数；关闭或重置会丢弃录像。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:119
#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/hall_of_fame_detail.html:32
msgid "Download counted video"
msgstr "下载带计数的视频"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:122
msgid "Anonymous display name"
msgstr "匿名显示名称"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:125
msgid ""
"Guest runs are labelled “guest” and cannot impersonate registered usernames. "
"Guest submissions have no self-service privacy or delete controls; contact "
"me with the public HOF link for changes."
msgstr ""
"访客记录会标注“guest”，且不能冒充已注册用户名。访客投稿无法自行切换隐私或删"
"除；如需修改，请把公开名人堂链接发给我。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:126
msgid "Log in before another run"
msgstr "下局开始前登录"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:126
msgid "if you want ownership controls."
msgstr "即可使用所有者管理功能。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:128
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Submitting as <strong>%(username)s</strong>. New submissions are public, but "
"you can later make the run private or delete it from My HOF."
msgstr ""
"将以 <strong>%(username)s</strong> 的身份提交。新投稿默认公开，之后可在“我的"
"名人堂”中设为私有或删除。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:130
msgid ""
"Anonymous submission is temporarily unavailable because the production human-"
"verification gate is not configured."
msgstr "生产环境的人机验证尚未配置，匿名投稿暂时不可用。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:134
msgid "Submit to Hall of Fame"
msgstr "提交到名人堂"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:135
#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:138
msgid "Discard recording"
msgstr "丢弃录像"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:137
msgid "Log in to submit this run"
msgstr "登录后提交本局"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:143
#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/typing.html:52
msgid "Share your result!"
msgstr "分享您的结果！"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:145
#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/typing.html:54
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "复制到剪贴板"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:154
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:155
msgid "PUBLICATION CONSENT"
msgstr "公开发布确认"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:156
msgid "Your video will be public"
msgstr "你的视频将会公开"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:157
msgid ""
"Submitting publishes this recording to the 67 Hall of Fame. Anyone can "
"watch, download and share it."
msgstr "提交后，这段录像会发布到 67 名人堂。任何人都可以观看、下载和分享。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:159
msgid ""
"Because you are logged in, you can make it private or delete it later from "
"My HOF."
msgstr "你已经登录，因此之后可以在“我的名人堂”中将其设为私有或删除。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:161
msgid ""
"Guest submissions cannot be privately managed or deleted by you later. "
"Contact the site owner with the HOF link if you need it removed."
msgstr ""
"访客投稿之后无法由你自行设为私有或删除。如需移除，请将名人堂链接发给站长。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:165
msgid "I understand that my video will be published for anyone to watch."
msgstr "我已知晓我的视频会被公开，任何人都可以观看。"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:168
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "暂不提交"

#: brainrot/templates/brainrot/counter.html:169
msgid "Publish this video"
msgstr "公开发布此视频"

